   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased $r--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.\n\nBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.\n\nHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.",
