  },
  "3419|dabc0513": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1456,
   "name": "Apothecary Zamah",
   "npc": "3419",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "For our people to survive, we must study the ways of nature and learn its secrets.",
   "time": 1792080483,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Thunder Bluff"
  },
  "3429|4e7d06f7": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Thork",
   "npc": "3429",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.\n\nThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do.",
   "time": 1792165627,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3430|0e16a4d2": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth.",
   "time": 1792166995,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3433|ac5dfa0b": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tatternack Steelforge",
   "npc": "3433",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and $r cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.\n\nHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur.",
   "time": 1792165771,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3442|ef9d74c5": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Sputtervalve",
   "npc": "3442",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Director Riddlevox put me in charge of the Union's shredder development program. Few months on the job and I'm already in hot water! I could use your help, $N!",
   "time": 1792091439,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3446|36457281": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mebok Mizzyrix",
   "npc": "3446",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Yes yes yes!  You're just the $r I'm looking for!\n\nSit!  We have much to discuss!!",
   "time": 1792091242,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3448|dcea3712": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tonga Runetotem",
   "npc": "3448",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
   "time": 1792094703,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3453|48c11c0f": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Wharfmaster Dizzywig",
   "npc": "3453",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Something I can help you with, $N? There's a shipment I've got to see to otherwise.",
   "time": 1792093289,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "5784|1a4f8770": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1414,
   "name": "Waldor",
   "npc": "5784",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents.",
   "time": 1792093897,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Wailing Caverns"
  },
  "7161|4df495bf": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Rogue",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Wrenix the Wretched",
   "npc": "7161",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Pirates. I hate them. I don't just hate them; I despise them with every fiber of my being. What with all the 'ARRRRR!' and 'YARRR!' and those awful birds they keep as pets - how could anyone stand pirates, let alone be a pirate?",
   "time": 1792093219,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "7166|912c996a": {
